    ],
    "cursorSync": "Off",
    "editable": true,
    "elements": {
      "panel-1": {
        "kind": "Panel",
        "spec": {
          "id": 1,
          "title": "Markdown",
          "description": "",
          "links": [],
          "data": {
            "kind": "QueryGroup",
            "spec": {
              "queries": [],
              "transformations": [],
              "queryOptions": {}
            }
          },
          "vizConfig": {
            "kind": "VizConfig",
            "group": "text",
            "version": "13.2.0-local",
            "spec": {
              "options": {
                "code": {
                  "language": "plaintext",
                  "showLineNumbers": false,
                  "showMiniMap": false
                },
                "content": "# Markdown syntax guide\n---\n\n## Headers\n\n# This is a Heading h1\n## This is a Heading h2\n###### This is a Heading h6\n\n---\n\n## Emphasis\n\n*This text will be italic*  \n_This will also be italic_\n\n**This text will be bold**  \n__This will also be bold__\n\n_You **can** combine them_\n\n---\n\n### Strikethrough\n\n~~The world is flat.~~\n\n---\n\n## Lists\n\n#### Unordered\n\n* Item 1\n* Item 2\n* Item 2a\n* Item 2b\n    * Item 3a\n    * Item 3b\n\n#### Ordered\n\n1. Item 1\n2. Item 2\n3. Item 3\n    1. Item 3a\n    2. Item 3b\n\n---\n\n## Images\n\n![alt text](https://grafana.com/static/img/menu/grafana2.svg)\n\n---\n\n## Links\n\n[Technical documentation](https://grafana.com/docs/)\n\n---\n\n## Blockquotes\n\n> Markdown is a lightweight markup language with plain-text-formatting syntax, created in 2004 by John Gruber with Aaron Swartz.\n>\n>> Markdown is often used to format readme files, for writing messages in online discussion forums, and to create rich text using a plain text editor.\n\n---\n\n## Tables\n\n| Left columns  | Right columns |\n| ------------- |:-------------:|\n| left foo      | right foo     |\n| left bar      | right bar     |\n| left baz      | right baz     |\n\n\n---\n\n## Blocks of code\n\n```\nlet message = 'Hello world';\nalert(message);\n```\n\n---\n\n## Inline code\n\nThis web site is using `code`.\n\n---\n\n### Task List\n\n- [x] Write the press release\n- [ ] Update the website\n- [ ] Contact the media\n      ",
                "mode": "markdown"
              },
              "fieldConfig": {
                "defaults": {},
                "overrides": []
              }
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "panel-2": {
        "kind": "Panel",
        "spec": {
          "id": 2,
          "title": "HTML",
          "description": "",
          "links": [],
          "data": {
            "kind": "QueryGroup",
            "spec": {
              "queries": [],
              "transformations": [],
              "queryOptions": {}
            }
          },
          "vizConfig": {
            "kind": "VizConfig",
            "group": "text",
            "version": "13.2.0-local",
            "spec": {
              "options": {
                "code": {
                  "language": "plaintext",
                  "showLineNumbers": false,
                  "showMiniMap": false
                },
                "content": "<h2>HTML</h2>\n<p>\n  This paragraph has <strong>bold</strong>, <em>italic</em>,\n  <u>underline</u>, <s>strikethrough</s>, and <code>inline code</code>.\n</p>\n<hr />\n<h3>Lists</h3>\n<ul>\n  <li>Unordered item one</li>\n  <li>Unordered item two\n    <ul>\n      <li>Nested item</li>\n    </ul>\n  </li>\n</ul>\n<ol>\n  <li>Ordered item one</li>\n  <li>Ordered item two</li>\n</ol>\n<hr />\n<h3>Links</h3>\n<p><a href=\"https://grafana.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer\">Grafana.com</a></p>\n<hr />\n<h3>Images</h3>\n<img src=\"https://grafana.com/static/img/menu/grafana2.svg\" alt=\"Grafana logo\" width=\"120\" />\n<hr />\n<h3>Table</h3>\n<table>\n  <thead>\n    <tr><th>Service</th><th>Status</th></tr>\n  </thead>\n  <tbody>\n    <tr><td>API</td><td>Healthy</td></tr>\n    <tr><td>Web</td><td>Degraded</td></tr>\n  </tbody>\n</table>\n<hr />\n<h3>Blockquote and rule</h3>\n<blockquote>OSS is in our DNA.</blockquote>\n<hr />\n<h3>Inline styling</h3>\n<p style=\"color: #ff7043; font-weight: bold;\">Styled orange text</p>\n<pre>preformatted\n  block\n    of text</pre>",
                "mode": "html"
              },
              "fieldConfig": {
                "defaults": {},
                "overrides": []
              }
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "panel-3": {
        "kind": "Panel",
        "spec": {
          "id": 3,
          "title": "Code Support with Language Syntax Highlighting",
          "description": "",
          "links": [],
          "data": {
            "kind": "QueryGroup",
            "spec": {
              "queries": [],
              "transformations": [],
              "queryOptions": {}
            }
          },
          "vizConfig": {
            "kind": "VizConfig",
            "group": "text",
            "version": "13.2.0-local",
            "spec": {
              "options": {
                "code": {
                  "language": "typescript",
                  "showLineNumbers": true,
                  "showMiniMap": true
                },
                "content": "interface User {\n  name: string;\n  id: number;\n}\n \nclass UserAccount {\n  name: string;\n  id: number;\n \n  constructor(name: string, id: number) {\n    this.name = name;\n    this.id = id;\n  }\n}\n \nconst user: User = new UserAccount(\"Murphy\", 1);",
                "mode": "code"
              },
              "fieldConfig": {
                "defaults": {},
                "overrides": []
              }
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "panel-4": {
        "kind": "Panel",
        "spec": {
          "id": 4,
          "title": "Every row",
          "description": "",
          "links": [],
          "data": {
            "kind": "QueryGroup",
            "spec": {
              "queries": [
                {
                  "kind": "PanelQuery",
                  "spec": {
                    "query": {
                      "kind": "DataQuery",
                      "group": "grafana-testdata-datasource",
                      "version": "v0",
                      "datasource": {
                        "name": "gdev-testdata"
                      },
                      "spec": {
                        "csvContent": "host,cpu\nweb-1,84\nweb-2,12\ndb-1,37",
                        "scenarioId": "csv_content"
                      }
                    },
                    "refId": "A",
                    "hidden": false
                  }
                }
              ],
              "transformations": [],
              "queryOptions": {}
            }
          },
          "vizConfig": {
            "kind": "VizConfig",
            "group": "text",
            "version": "13.2.0-local",
            "spec": {
              "options": {
                "code": {
                  "language": "plaintext",
                  "showLineNumbers": false,
                  "showMiniMap": false
                },
                "content": "- **${__data.fields.host}** \u2014 ${__data.fields.cpu}%",
                "mode": "markdown",
                "renderMode": "everyRow"
              },
              "fieldConfig": {
                "defaults": {},
                "overrides": []
              }
            }
          }
        }
      }
